WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:02:12.916 --> 00:02:16.166
The dark force is extremely strong tonight.

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:24.041
My name's Cula, and I'm a vampire.

00:02:24.041 --> 00:02:26.833
I am hiding, no, trapped in this school 

00:02:26.833 --> 00:02:30.250
for complicated reasons.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.541
Although I can't escape this place,

00:02:32.541 --> 00:02:35.166
it also can't confine my free spirit.

00:02:36.333 --> 00:02:40.208
Well, this universe is too small for me anyway.

00:02:42.416 --> 00:02:44.208
So where am I going now? 

00:02:44.208 --> 00:02:47.000
To enjoy the only freedom I've got! 

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.250
Tomato juice! 

00:02:54.458 --> 00:02:58.208
I can't start my day without this! 

00:03:01.166 --> 00:03:03.041
