00:03:08.625 --> 00:03:12.250
You look handsome as always! 

00:03:16.541 --> 00:03:17.291
Hey, Cula! 

00:03:32.375 --> 00:03:34.750
Ugh... popularity...what a bother.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:38.375
But someone like me can't help being liked by everyone.

00:03:38.375 --> 00:03:41.333
Everyone except...This kid 

00:03:41.333 --> 00:03:43.083
He thinks he's my rival.

00:03:43.083 --> 00:03:45.625
but he's obviously no match for me.

00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:11.375
Ugh!

00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:14.833
The Human doodles on the desk every day! 

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:18.416
I can't stand mess.

00:04:18.416 --> 00:04:21.958
Things have to be nice and spotless before I can sit down. 

00:04:22.833 --> 00:04:24.666
So... I guess I should introduce everyone 

00:04:24.666 --> 00:04:28.375
That's Zizi. She's a zombie. 

00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:30.291
That's Kong Kong, a hopping zombie. 

00:04:30.291 --> 00:04:32.333
Kebi is a prankster.

00:04:32.333 --> 00:04:35.041
And Frankie is easily fooled by him! 

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:36.958
I am so tired of being responsible for cleaning up 

00:04:36.958 --> 00:04:39.875
after these weirdos...!

00:04:54.458 --> 00:04:56.750
He's here! He's here! He's coming!

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.166
Right now, he's coming! 

00:04:59.166 --> 00:05:00.541
Hurry! 

00:05:00.541 --> 00:05:01.625
Come on! 

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:33.416
No...keep calm...mind control...

00:06:41.875 --> 00:06:43.416
Well done, Cula 

00:06:45.375 --> 00:06:51.083
You need to work harder on your skills for hiding from humans. All of you.

00:07:00.625 --> 00:07:05.375
Today, we'll learn about the human's latest weapon of choice.

00:07:05.375 --> 00:07:08.000
It's called the cellphone 

00:07:09.708 --> 00:07:10.750
According to our research, 

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:14.750
this weapon is powerful beyond imagination.

00:07:15.416 --> 00:07:17.500
Where have I seen that? 

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.625
Humans use cellphones...

00:07:19.625 --> 00:07:21.958
...to practice attacking us at will.

00:07:22.833 --> 00:07:25.458
I've seen that thing somewhere... 

00:07:25.458 --> 00:07:27.083
No human can get through a 

00:07:27.083 --> 00:07:29.250
single day without their phone.

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:31.250
And in case they lose their phone,

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.083
