00:07:37.666 --> 00:07:38.500
Uh, Mr. Reaper! 

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:39.708
Come look...!

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:41.833
Oh no!

00:07:41.833 --> 00:07:43.458
Cula! 

00:07:43.458 --> 00:07:47.125
You mustn't touch it no matter what, is that clear? 

00:07:47.125 --> 00:07:48.041
But if!

00:07:48.041 --> 00:07:51.000
If you do touch a human's belongings...

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:51.958
You must!

00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:52.708
At all costs!

00:07:52.708 --> 00:07:54.166
Always!

00:07:54.166 --> 00:07:56.250
Put it back as you found it!

00:07:56.541 --> 00:07:57.250
Yes, sir...!

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.500
Pop Quiz! 

00:08:01.125 --> 00:08:03.083
What symptoms would a human display 

00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:05.125
if they lost their cellphone? 

00:08:05.875 --> 00:08:06.708
Symptoms....symptoms..!

00:08:06.708 --> 00:08:08.791
Come on.. think!

00:08:08.791 --> 00:08:09.583
They'll be anxious 

00:08:09.583 --> 00:08:10.166
without their weap- 

00:08:10.166 --> 00:08:10.666
Oh! They will be anxious without 

00:08:10.666 --> 00:08:13.041
their weapon...!

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.125
Bingo! 

00:08:22.541 --> 00:08:25.833
It's said that a human who loses their phone 

00:08:25.833 --> 00:08:32.166
will experience extreme anxiety, crankiness, hallucinations, and diarrhea 

00:08:32.166 --> 00:08:35.000
When they secure evidence like photos and videos- 

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:35.541
KEBI! 

00:08:35.541 --> 00:08:36.791
FOCUS! 

00:08:42.583 --> 00:08:44.750
10 minute recess! 

00:08:48.958 --> 00:08:53.083
Where'd it go?! Wh-where'd it... go?! 

00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:57.500
It's about to get crazy in here because, 

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.583
