My candy! 

00:10:03.666 --> 00:10:06.208
Geez....whatta scene!

00:10:06.208 --> 00:10:08.250
Over a silly lollipop? 

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.000
How pathetic.

00:10:21.875 --> 00:10:23.166
Wha...what is it...?

00:10:26.375 --> 00:10:28.416
Do you... want it? 

00:10:28.416 --> 00:10:30.666
Yuck~~! No thanks! You can have it..!

00:10:30.666 --> 00:10:33.416
I'm not that big on candy!

00:10:33.416 --> 00:10:35.125
Get away~~~!

00:10:37.791 --> 00:10:39.625
If I had one wish, 

00:10:39.625 --> 00:10:45.041
it would be to live in peace by myself, far from everyone.

00:11:07.458 --> 00:11:08.875
What's this doing in here?! 

00:11:14.583 --> 00:11:15.583
Hello?

00:11:15.583 --> 00:11:16.958
Hello? 

00:11:34.083 --> 00:11:36.708
If you do touch a human's belongings..

00:11:36.708 --> 00:11:37.625
You MUST! 

00:11:37.625 --> 00:11:38.291
At all costs!

00:11:38.291 --> 00:11:39.416
Always!

00:11:39.416 --> 00:11:41.625
Put it back as you found it! 

00:11:42.041 --> 00:11:44.583
Oh, man... what do I do now? 

00:11:47.291 --> 00:11:50.625
I'll just put it back real quick!

00:12:01.375 --> 00:12:02.750
Ow ow! Ow, hot!

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:03.666
Wahhhh~! Wah~!

00:12:03.666 --> 00:12:04.208
Oh!

00:12:04.208 --> 00:12:05.875
Oh! Whaaa! Oh! ahh!!

00:12:38.333 --> 00:12:39.458
Hey Hanah! 

00:12:39.458 --> 00:12:41.458
Why are you here so early? 

00:12:41.458 --> 00:12:44.208
Oh... I think I left my phone in homeroom, 

00:12:44.208 --> 00:12:46.125
