00:13:44.458 --> 00:13:45.000
See ya! 

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:45.833
Let's go to my house 

00:13:45.833 --> 00:13:46.291
Have a nice day!

00:13:46.291 --> 00:13:47.333
And eat some delicious cake!

00:13:47.333 --> 00:13:47.541
Bye!

00:13:47.875 --> 00:13:48.333
Bye!

00:13:48.833 --> 00:13:49.416
Bye!

00:14:17.958 --> 00:14:18.875
That phone! 

00:14:21.291 --> 00:14:23.291
This phone is mine!!

00:14:49.458 --> 00:14:52.291
Not only did you steal my phone, 

00:14:52.291 --> 00:14:54.041
