00:14:54.041 --> 00:14:56.166
You're in so much trouble! 

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.750
Don't be such a baby and wait here 

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.833
I'll go bring the teacher.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:15.291
Hurry-! He's right....oh?

00:15:15.291 --> 00:15:17.208
He was right there! 

00:15:17.208 --> 00:15:19.000
I told you it's the ghost. 

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:20.666
I saw it moving around last night 

00:15:20.666 --> 00:15:23.500
and I swear I heard footsteps in the empty classrooms.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:26.333
The classrooms, they were completely empty!

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.458
All I'm saying...hear me out

00:15:31.458 --> 00:15:33.708
I happen to know an excellent exorcist...

00:15:33.708 --> 00:15:35.375
...and I think we should contact him.

00:15:35.375 --> 00:15:38.000
Oh~that's a great idea. 

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.750
Why don't you bring him in? 

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.000
We'll exorcise the ghost, 

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:45.083
