00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.166
Parents will be thrilled about a school exorcism!

00:15:48.166 --> 00:15:51.291
The kids will get super excited and flock to us!

00:15:51.291 --> 00:15:53.041
Hm!

00:15:53.333 --> 00:15:54.791
Get your act together 

00:15:54.791 --> 00:15:57.416
And get back to work RIGHT NOW!!

00:15:58.625 --> 00:16:00.916
