00:16:24.875 --> 00:16:26.750
Yes, sir. 

00:16:37.750 --> 00:16:40.375
Hello. How may I be of service?

00:16:40.375 --> 00:16:45.833
Yes, um...Do you deal with ghosts that appear in schools? 

00:16:45.833 --> 00:16:47.833
What's the address?

00:17:01.875 --> 00:17:03.958
Dad? 

00:17:03.958 --> 00:17:05.166
Yeah, sweetie? 

00:17:05.166 --> 00:17:06.125
