00:17:08.416 --> 00:17:10.083
Oh Good! You found it! 

00:17:11.916 --> 00:17:14.208
Oh, Hanah? Did you drop it? 

00:17:14.208 --> 00:17:15.833
No, it wasn't me, dad!

00:17:15.833 --> 00:17:16.916
Never mind.

00:17:16.916 --> 00:17:19.541
You spend WAY too much time on it anyway.

00:17:22.666 --> 00:17:26.250
