00:17:42.708 --> 00:17:44.250
Father! 

00:17:47.166 --> 00:17:49.458
Getting straight A's might be stretching it! 

00:17:49.458 --> 00:17:51.041
How about B's? 

00:17:51.041 --> 00:17:51.791
Ah~~

00:17:51.791 --> 00:17:53.083
A's or nothing.

00:17:53.083 --> 00:17:55.500
Oh that's impossible, dad!

00:17:55.500 --> 00:17:58.000
Then ask whoever broke your phone to fix it~~

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.583
I don't think that kid's from my school.

00:18:00.583 --> 00:18:01.500
No A's, 

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:02.541
No phone. 

00:18:02.541 --> 00:18:03.000
Got it?

00:18:03.000 --> 00:18:04.208
Good luck~

00:18:04.208 --> 00:18:05.583
My phone!

00:18:05.583 --> 00:18:08.541
Agggghhhahaha! 

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.416
Why did she help me? 

00:18:34.291 --> 00:18:35.083
Oh, no! 

00:18:36.125 --> 00:18:38.333
Come on! It won't erase!

00:18:39.333 --> 00:18:41.500
Oh, why is my life like this?! 

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:42.083
See. 

00:18:42.083 --> 00:18:43.458
I told you~

00:18:43.458 --> 00:18:44.250
Huh?

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.958
Right? I mean...

00:18:46.791 --> 00:18:48.458
Hey Kong Kong, you ask him.

00:18:48.458 --> 00:18:52.083
Me? You're the suspicious one. You ask. 

00:18:52.083 --> 00:18:53.541
Frankie, you ask him.

00:18:53.541 --> 00:18:54.625
Ask me what? 

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:57.958
About this! 

00:18:59.416 --> 00:19:02.708
Cula~Kebi keeps saying this drawing looks like you.

00:19:02.708 --> 00:19:06.708
Wh-what?! This?! Come on! It looks nothing like me?! 

00:19:06.708 --> 00:19:07.791
Take a look!

00:19:07.791 --> 00:19:09.041
Round eyes

00:19:09.041 --> 00:19:10.583
Spiky hair

00:19:10.583 --> 00:19:12.291
Thin lips

00:19:12.291 --> 00:19:13.875
It obviously looks JUST

00:19:13.875 --> 00:19:14.666
- AH!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.333
What?

00:19:16.333 --> 00:19:17.083
Continue

00:19:17.083 --> 00:19:17.750
you were saying?

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.083
Stop messing around!

00:19:19.083 --> 00:19:21.333
This definitely looks like you, and it was drawn by a human.

00:19:21.333 --> 00:19:23.250
So I think you have some explaining to do,

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:23.875
Cula!

00:19:25.666 --> 00:19:26.333
Hey!

00:19:26.333 --> 00:19:28.291
You need to get your eyes fixed, Kebi!

00:19:28.291 --> 00:19:30.625
This looks NOTHING like Cula~!

00:19:30.625 --> 00:19:33.666
It could be anyone with round eyes. 

00:19:33.666 --> 00:19:35.916
A round-eyed... bum! 

00:19:35.916 --> 00:19:39.666
Look at the unruly hair. It's gotta be some kind of...

00:19:39.666 --> 00:19:40.416
Round eyed...

00:19:40.416 --> 00:19:42.291
human bum!

00:19:42.291 --> 00:19:43.458
Right Cula?

00:19:43.458 --> 00:19:44.250
Yeah right.

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:46.916
This look nothing like me Kebi.

00:19:46.916 --> 00:19:47.333
Hm!

00:19:47.333 --> 00:19:51.708
Well, judging from the way you've been acting and that mark on your arm, 

00:19:51.708 --> 00:19:57.375
I think this picture proves that you went out into the human world and got burned in the sunlight!

00:19:59.791 --> 00:20:02.250
Why would Cula show himself to human? 

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.666
He's not a dodo-brain!

00:20:03.666 --> 00:20:07.000
According to you...Cula's so loony 

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:10.916
that he went into the human world with huge crazy eyes looking like a human bum...

00:20:10.916 --> 00:20:13.958
and got caught in broad daylight by a human?

00:20:13.958 --> 00:20:15.875
Does that make any sense to you?! 

00:20:15.875 --> 00:20:19.041
It's absurd just hearing myself say it! 

00:20:19.041 --> 00:20:20.458
Thank you, Kong Kong 

00:20:20.458 --> 00:20:21.125
Now...

00:20:21.125 --> 00:20:23.208
can you get off my desk please? 

00:20:23.208 --> 00:20:25.291
Oh, sorry. Got carried away... 

00:20:25.291 --> 00:20:26.375
Whatever~

00:20:26.375 --> 00:20:28.541
Look Cula! I got my eye on you! 

00:20:28.541 --> 00:20:29.916
Be careful.

00:20:31.875 --> 00:20:35.708
How can he notice everything with just one eye? 

00:20:35.708 --> 00:20:39.583
Oh..is it because he only has one eye? 

00:20:39.583 --> 00:20:43.333
Why... won't this thing... come off already? 

00:21:02.333 --> 00:21:03.583
My drawing... 

00:21:03.958 --> 00:21:05.625
who erased it?! 

00:21:09.083 --> 00:21:10.250
It's him! 

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:13.458
He was cleaning my desk then too! 

00:21:15.541 --> 00:21:18.875
Maybe he'll come back... 

00:21:29.416 --> 00:21:31.708
Let's see...what have we got here? 

00:21:46.291 --> 00:21:47.875
Excuse me sir...

00:21:47.875 --> 00:21:48.958
you are? 

00:21:48.958 --> 00:21:49.833
Ah! 

00:21:49.833 --> 00:21:52.541
Let me give you my card. 

00:21:53.666 --> 00:21:54.333
Oh, great! 

00:21:54.333 --> 00:21:55.083
You are here!

00:21:55.083 --> 00:21:56.333
Principal Kong.

00:21:56.333 --> 00:21:57.500
I called the exorcist, sir.

00:21:58.458 --> 00:22:02.541
There are no ghosts in my school, so turn around and go.

00:22:03.666 --> 00:22:05.166
If you change your mind, 

00:22:05.166 --> 00:22:07.291
give me a call anytime.

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:20.416
Nice and clean. Perfect 

00:22:47.208 --> 00:22:49.666
Oh, must have fallen asleep... 

00:22:51.666 --> 00:22:53.375
Oh! There you are! 

00:22:55.791 --> 00:22:58.375
What're you doing here this late at night? 

00:22:58.708 --> 00:23:00.458
Why are all the lights off? 

00:23:00.458 --> 00:23:03.166
Owwww! Pins and needles! 

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:15.250
My phone! 

00:23:17.833 --> 00:23:20.666
I want you to pay for a new phone.

00:23:20.666 --> 00:23:22.833
But I didn't take your phone.

00:23:22.833 --> 00:23:25.500
When I went back to my locker, it was in my bag.

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:28.250
What locker? What're you talking about? 

00:23:28.625 --> 00:23:31.666
I mean... I... found your phone In my bag

00:23:31.666 --> 00:23:33.666
So I was only returning it.

00:23:33.666 --> 00:23:36.208
Ah! So you're saying my phone grew legs

00:23:36.208 --> 00:23:40.125
and walked right into your bag and you were simply bringing it back? 

00:23:40.125 --> 00:23:42.166
You expect me to believe that?! 

00:23:44.958 --> 00:23:45.833
You broke it! 

00:23:45.833 --> 00:23:46.666
You fix it! 

00:23:46.666 --> 00:23:47.833
Fix my phone!

00:23:52.583 --> 00:23:55.375
How come... he... only has one eye? 

00:24:04.208 --> 00:24:06.125
Hey! What are they?

00:24:11.083 --> 00:24:14.166
Muh...MONSTER!

00:24:28.708 --> 00:24:30.208
Is she dead? 

00:24:31.416 --> 00:24:33.500
She's still alive. She's drooling.

00:24:33.500 --> 00:24:34.375
Are you sure? 

00:24:38.375 --> 00:24:40.375
I knew this was going to happen! 

00:24:40.375 --> 00:24:42.708
I've been telling you how weird Cula has been lately! 

00:24:42.708 --> 00:24:45.666
Thanks to you, we'll have to move to a new place now! 

00:24:45.666 --> 00:24:47.000
Move?! 

00:24:48.250 --> 00:24:48.750
He's coming! 

00:24:48.833 --> 00:24:49.416
He's coming! 

00:25:17.375 --> 00:25:20.958
Humans are much crueler than you can ever imagine.

00:25:24.833 --> 00:25:27.041
In order to deal with them, 

00:25:27.041 --> 00:25:31.958
we should be prepared to use any means necessary to ensure our safety.

00:25:32.250 --> 00:25:33.250
Wow!

00:25:33.250 --> 00:25:34.791
NOT possible!

00:25:34.791 --> 00:25:37.375
10 minute recess 

00:25:41.250 --> 00:25:43.291
Don't come any closer!

00:25:43.291 --> 00:25:44.875
She's seen us, 

00:25:44.875 --> 00:25:46.375
so we can't let her go now.

00:25:46.375 --> 00:25:50.458
If we do, she'll tell other humans about us, then we're all doomed!

00:25:51.375 --> 00:25:52.875
That's not good~~

00:25:52.875 --> 00:25:54.625
We don't have any other choice.

00:25:54.625 --> 00:25:56.958
We must...get rid of her...

00:25:56.958 --> 00:25:58.541
...without a single trace.

00:25:58.541 --> 00:25:59.541
NO WAY!

00:25:59.833 --> 00:26:06.791
I mean... well... if she disappears, then we could end up in real danger.

00:26:06.791 --> 00:26:08.666
Why? 

00:26:08.666 --> 00:26:10.625
Because... uh... 

00:26:10.625 --> 00:26:12.291
Missing child case! 

00:26:12.291 --> 00:26:13.875
Missing child case? 

00:26:13.875 --> 00:26:14.583
That's right! 

00:26:14.583 --> 00:26:18.083
When a child goes missing the whole town will become frantic!

00:26:18.083 --> 00:26:22.125
People will turn this entire school upside down looking for me.

00:26:22.125 --> 00:26:25.083
because the last place I was seen was right here.

00:26:25.083 --> 00:26:27.125
That IS real danger.

00:26:27.125 --> 00:26:28.958
SERIOUS danger...!

00:26:28.958 --> 00:26:30.708
Didn't you hear what Mr. Reaper said?! 

00:26:30.708 --> 00:26:32.041
Humans have cellphones now!

00:26:32.041 --> 00:26:33.708
So even little humans are dangerous!

00:26:33.708 --> 00:26:34.583
Ah~! That's right! 

00:26:34.583 --> 00:26:36.875
She doesn't have a cellphone!

00:26:36.875 --> 00:26:38.958
Yes! That's right! I don't.

00:26:38.958 --> 00:26:40.625
Because....he smashed it.

00:26:40.625 --> 00:26:43.250
Be quiet~!

00:26:43.625 --> 00:26:45.208
So don't make things worse 

00:26:45.208 --> 00:26:47.750
If you let me go, I won't tell anyone. 

00:26:48.958 --> 00:26:50.750
She makes a good point~

00:26:50.750 --> 00:26:52.250
Think about it...

00:26:52.250 --> 00:26:54.500
If something happens to her, 

00:26:54.500 --> 00:26:56.583
then we might really have to move.

00:26:56.583 --> 00:26:57.750
MOVE!I 

00:26:57.750 --> 00:27:01.125
I don't wanna move! 

00:27:01.125 --> 00:27:02.041
Fine!

00:27:02.041 --> 00:27:03.166
Have it your way!

00:27:03.166 --> 00:27:04.875
But if anything happens...

00:27:04.875 --> 00:27:06.958
it's all on you, Cula~!

00:27:06.958 --> 00:27:08.416
Nothing's going to happen.

00:27:08.416 --> 00:27:09.916
Right? 

00:27:09.916 --> 00:27:11.000
Of course not!

00:27:12.333 --> 00:27:13.125
See ya! 

00:27:25.083 --> 00:27:29.500
Huh... Dad must be working late again.

00:27:35.083 --> 00:27:41.083
Uh~I must be the unluckiest kid in the world.

00:27:41.083 --> 00:27:44.041
Do I really have to live without a phone?

00:27:46.250 --> 00:27:48.958
Oh yeah..they called him Cula.

00:27:56.708 --> 00:27:59.416
V-A-M-P-I-R-E 

00:28:03.541 --> 00:28:04.958
What's this?

00:28:09.958 --> 00:28:13.041
They didn't seem all that evil... 

00:28:32.083 --> 00:28:35.208
He said something about a locker... 

00:28:35.208 --> 00:28:37.666
A locker that he can fit in... 

00:28:39.333 --> 00:28:40.833
I didn't know this place existed.

00:28:57.500 --> 00:28:59.125
Why won't this open! 

00:29:06.666 --> 00:29:07.583
Wow! 

00:29:07.583 --> 00:29:09.333
You live in this thing?! 

00:29:10.083 --> 00:29:11.083
Shhhh! 

00:29:11.291 --> 00:29:13.125
You promised us

00:29:13.125 --> 00:29:16.208
You said you'd never speak of us, and forget ever seeing us!

00:29:16.208 --> 00:29:18.208
I didn't tell anyone! 

00:29:18.208 --> 00:29:22.458
Then forget about us too! Wipe us from your memory! Please I beg you!

00:29:22.458 --> 00:29:24.750
We can't never ever meet again, got it?

00:29:25.166 --> 00:29:27.791
I didn't wanna see you either.

00:29:27.791 --> 00:29:30.583
But you broke my phone and you need to pay up!

00:29:31.500 --> 00:29:31.791
Ow!

00:29:33.625 --> 00:29:34.416
One, two!

00:29:34.791 --> 00:29:36.458
Testing!

00:29:36.458 --> 00:29:37.708
Attention!

00:29:37.708 --> 00:29:39.416
Students of Bora Elementary School! 

00:29:39.416 --> 00:29:40.875
Sh~! Okay!

00:29:40.875 --> 00:29:42.625
I'll pay for your phone!

00:29:42.625 --> 00:29:44.416
That's more like it.

00:29:48.583 --> 00:29:49.375
Here!

00:29:49.375 --> 00:29:50.291
Keep the change.

00:29:50.291 --> 00:29:52.708
Now, never come back here. Okay?

00:29:54.833 --> 00:29:55.791
wow 

00:29:56.708 --> 00:29:58.333
Are you kidding me?! 

00:29:58.333 --> 00:30:00.125
You gotta give me actual money!

00:30:00.125 --> 00:30:00.833
Paper money!

00:30:00.833 --> 00:30:02.458
Not coins!

00:30:02.458 --> 00:30:04.000
Ahhhhhhhhhh!

00:30:04.000 --> 00:30:05.041
I have no phone!

00:30:05.041 --> 00:30:08.041
How am I gonna call my friends now?

00:30:08.041 --> 00:30:08.958
Shhh!

00:30:09.083 --> 00:30:09.750
Be quiet..! 

00:30:10.083 --> 00:30:11.500
Be quiet please...!

00:30:13.000 --> 00:30:15.708
So...you can get a new phone

00:30:15.708 --> 00:30:17.625
by either me giving you money

00:30:17.625 --> 00:30:19.416
or you getting all A's in your classes...

00:30:19.416 --> 00:30:20.958
those are your 2 options?

00:30:21.458 --> 00:30:22.583
It's simple then,

00:30:22.583 --> 00:30:23.875
You just have to get all A's.

00:30:23.875 --> 00:30:26.291
Hey! It's not that easy.

00:30:26.291 --> 00:30:29.333
If it was, I wouldn't have come looking for you.

00:30:29.333 --> 00:30:31.291
But if I don't give you money to buy a new phone,

00:30:31.291 --> 00:30:33.125
you'll come here every day, right?

00:30:33.125 --> 00:30:33.958
Right! 

00:30:33.958 --> 00:30:35.458
And bother me and make noise? 

00:30:35.458 --> 00:30:36.208
Uh-huh! 

00:30:36.208 --> 00:30:38.000
You'll never give up or get tired? 

00:30:38.000 --> 00:30:39.416
Of course not!

00:30:39.416 --> 00:30:41.333
Ugh~~~~!

00:30:41.458 --> 00:30:42.166
Fine. 

00:30:42.375 --> 00:30:44.458
Then I'll help you get all A's.

00:30:45.166 --> 00:30:45.500
What?

00:30:46.375 --> 00:30:47.875
Hahahaha!

00:30:48.125 --> 00:30:49.500
Hahahaha!

00:30:49.500 --> 00:30:50.458
HELP me? 

00:30:50.458 --> 00:30:51.166
You?

00:30:51.166 --> 00:30:55.041
You're gonna do what my teachers and tutors and parents couldn't do?

00:30:55.041 --> 00:30:57.750
All those people tried and failed...

00:30:57.750 --> 00:31:00.625
But you're going to miraculously help me get all A's?!

00:31:00.625 --> 00:31:03.250
When I put my mind to it, I get things done!

00:31:03.250 --> 00:31:04.208
No way! 

00:31:04.208 --> 00:31:05.375
Impossible!

00:31:05.375 --> 00:31:06.000
Yes way!

00:31:06.000 --> 00:31:06.958
Possible!

00:31:06.958 --> 00:31:09.166
Do you even know what subjects I'm studying? 

00:31:09.166 --> 00:31:10.500
Give me a break!

00:31:10.500 --> 00:31:12.666
I'm 109 years old.

00:31:12.666 --> 00:31:15.208
A human child's school lesson is a piece of cake.

00:31:16.083 --> 00:31:16.916
Whatever.

00:31:16.916 --> 00:31:18.625
As long as I get my phone back.

00:31:18.625 --> 00:31:21.625
I've got absolutely nothing to lose here.

00:31:23.041 --> 00:31:25.416
Let's meet in the classroom tonight.

00:31:25.416 --> 00:31:27.750
Say... around 5:30?

00:31:27.750 --> 00:31:28.416
Ok?

00:31:31.000 --> 00:31:32.708
Not like that~

00:31:32.708 --> 00:31:33.833
Like

00:31:34.083 --> 00:31:34.666
This

00:31:35.125 --> 00:31:36.208
When you do this, 

00:31:36.208 --> 00:31:39.083
It means you are locking hearts with another person 

00:31:39.083 --> 00:31:40.541
and you are making a promise.

00:31:40.541 --> 00:31:42.083
You're not really a person, but... 

00:31:42.083 --> 00:31:43.208
whatevs!

00:31:43.208 --> 00:31:46.166
We made a promise, so it counts just the same.

00:31:46.166 --> 00:31:47.833
You gotta stick to it.

00:31:55.458 --> 00:31:58.708
No matter what we do, we don't seem to get more students.

00:32:08.083 --> 00:32:11.875
But looking at you makes me feel so much better.

00:32:11.875 --> 00:32:14.041
I will defend this school's honor...

00:32:14.041 --> 00:32:16.041
as the district's best! 

00:32:23.666 --> 00:32:24.291
What?

00:32:24.541 --> 00:32:26.541
You'll help me too? 

00:32:28.208 --> 00:32:29.708
Oh! Isn't that lovely? 

00:32:29.708 --> 00:32:31.833
My precious! 

00:32:43.958 --> 00:32:46.416
Start the first lesson with charisma!

00:32:55.708 --> 00:32:58.041
Here I am, little girl! 

00:33:16.208 --> 00:33:17.458
What's he doing?

00:33:21.708 --> 00:33:22.416
Ew!

00:33:22.416 --> 00:33:23.833
What a mess! 

00:33:30.833 --> 00:33:31.541
Alright! 

00:33:31.541 --> 00:33:33.041
When's your first test!

00:33:33.375 --> 00:33:36.416
This is today, and test start around here.

00:33:36.625 --> 00:33:39.666
So~~that means we've got about one week to study.

00:33:39.666 --> 00:33:40.333
What?

00:33:40.333 --> 00:33:41.250
One week?!

00:33:41.250 --> 00:33:42.375
Thats' it?

00:33:42.625 --> 00:33:43.541
Wait! 

00:33:43.541 --> 00:33:45.291
You were talking so big last time...

00:33:45.291 --> 00:33:47.458
Don't you have some kind of super power?

00:33:47.458 --> 00:33:48.791
Like in the movies and books.

00:33:49.416 --> 00:33:50.666
Super power...?

00:33:50.833 --> 00:33:51.125
Ah! 

00:33:51.500 --> 00:33:53.958
I am really disappointed in you~

00:33:53.958 --> 00:33:55.916
You should study hard for tests, 

00:33:55.916 --> 00:33:57.208
not just take short cuts...

00:33:57.208 --> 00:33:58.333
Uh!

00:33:58.333 --> 00:34:00.125
Or wait until the last minute!

00:34:00.125 --> 00:34:00.708
Wow...

00:34:00.708 --> 00:34:03.041
I feel... I've been tricked somehow. 

00:34:03.208 --> 00:34:04.291
All right. 

00:34:04.291 --> 00:34:05.541
Let's start with Spanish.

00:34:07.458 --> 00:34:08.500
It's pretty easy.

00:34:09.000 --> 00:34:10.458
It's easy? 

00:34:10.458 --> 00:34:11.416
yeah 

00:34:11.416 --> 00:34:13.125
What's this? 

00:34:13.125 --> 00:34:14.375
Too hard.

00:34:14.375 --> 00:34:15.791
Pass! 

00:34:17.000 --> 00:34:19.125
Let's start with something more basic.

00:34:19.125 --> 00:34:21.458
Step by step, you know? 

00:34:26.000 --> 00:34:27.000
Pass! 

00:34:27.000 --> 00:34:28.250
You really don't know?

00:34:28.250 --> 00:34:28.916
Pass!

00:34:28.916 --> 00:34:30.250
Do you know what 'pass' means?! 

00:34:31.333 --> 00:34:31.958
Stop! 

00:34:31.958 --> 00:34:33.625
I know this one! 

00:34:33.625 --> 00:34:35.458
'Toe-Man-teh'!

00:34:37.041 --> 00:34:37.541
What?

00:34:37.541 --> 00:34:39.041
'Toe-Man-teh'?!

00:34:39.041 --> 00:34:40.750
That sounds ridiculous!

00:34:40.750 --> 00:34:42.000
'Toe-mah-toe' 

00:34:42.000 --> 00:34:44.125
No, it's pronounced 'toe-man-teh!

00:34:44.125 --> 00:34:46.958
I may not know many Spanish words, but I know food! 

00:34:46.958 --> 00:34:48.500
You obviously don't.

00:34:48.500 --> 00:34:51.083
Because this is 'toe-mah-toe'. 

00:34:51.083 --> 00:34:52.833
I'm pretty sure it's 'toe-man-teh'...

00:34:52.833 --> 00:34:54.166
Repeat after me 

00:34:54.166 --> 00:34:54.625
Toe! 

00:34:54.708 --> 00:34:55.333
Toe! 

00:34:55.333 --> 00:34:55.708
Mah! 

00:34:55.791 --> 00:34:56.333
Mah! 

00:34:56.333 --> 00:34:57.000
Toe! 

00:34:57.166 --> 00:34:57.916
Toe! 

00:34:57.916 --> 00:34:59.583
Toe...mah...TEH!

00:34:59.958 --> 00:35:02.125
Ugh... let's move on...

00:35:03.666 --> 00:35:04.583
Next!

00:35:06.166 --> 00:35:06.708
Pizza! 

00:35:08.583 --> 00:35:09.333
I'm shook!

00:35:09.333 --> 00:35:10.583
I'm a genius!

00:35:10.583 --> 00:35:12.125
I got 2 answers in a row!

00:35:12.125 --> 00:35:14.375
Pizza! Pizza-pizza-pizza! Pizza-pizza-

00:35:14.375 --> 00:35:15.291
Yay~!

00:35:15.458 --> 00:35:15.875
Ugh...

00:35:16.208 --> 00:35:17.583
Now I'm hungry.

00:35:17.916 --> 00:35:20.000
I can't focus when I'm hungry. 

00:35:20.000 --> 00:35:22.041
Do you have anything to eat?

00:35:22.833 --> 00:35:23.333
Come on! 

00:35:23.333 --> 00:35:25.000
We just got started! 

00:35:25.541 --> 00:35:26.166
Wow~!

00:35:26.166 --> 00:35:29.125
Your canine teeth are really sharp! 

00:35:29.125 --> 00:35:30.250
Have you ever bitten a human? 

00:35:30.250 --> 00:35:31.708
What does blood taste like? 

00:35:31.708 --> 00:35:33.125
Do people taste different?

00:35:33.125 --> 00:35:34.000
What would mine taste like? 

00:35:34.000 --> 00:35:35.041
Who tastes better - 

00:35:35.041 --> 00:35:37.208
Men, women, or children? 

00:35:37.208 --> 00:35:37.916
Just focus!

00:35:37.916 --> 00:35:40.500
How can you not concentrate for one second?

00:35:40.500 --> 00:35:41.666
Forget about A's! 

00:35:41.666 --> 00:35:43.958
You'll be lucky to pass the test at all~!

00:35:46.583 --> 00:35:48.708
I'm really tired from all this studying.

00:35:49.541 --> 00:35:52.250
Let's take a nap then start again with clear heads. 

00:35:52.250 --> 00:35:53.291
Sounds good?

00:35:54.083 --> 00:35:54.750
HEY-!

00:35:54.750 --> 00:35:56.208
You call this STUDYING?

00:35:56.208 --> 00:35:57.625
There's no time for napping!

00:35:57.625 --> 00:35:59.791
Get yourself together and learn some words!

00:36:01.458 --> 00:36:02.583
Jirafa (giraffe)

00:36:03.291 --> 00:36:04.125
Dificil (difficult)

00:36:04.791 --> 00:36:05.541
Perra (dog)

00:36:06.875 --> 00:36:07.208
Wait...

00:36:07.541 --> 00:36:08.458
What? 

00:36:08.458 --> 00:36:09.416
What's wrong with you? 

00:36:09.416 --> 00:36:10.000
Hey~

00:36:10.000 --> 00:36:11.416
Hey~Wake up~!

00:36:11.416 --> 00:36:12.958
You are scaring me!

00:36:12.958 --> 00:36:15.083
Wake up~

00:36:15.083 --> 00:36:16.166
Snap out of it; 

00:36:16.166 --> 00:36:17.291
Wake up-!!

00:36:19.208 --> 00:36:21.791
Whoa... did I fall asleep? 

00:36:21.791 --> 00:36:23.333
How long was I out for? 

00:36:23.750 --> 00:36:26.625
Yeah, but only for a second.

00:36:26.625 --> 00:36:28.000
Now, let's study. 

00:36:28.500 --> 00:36:29.833
So weird...

00:36:29.833 --> 00:36:31.666
What just happened right now?

00:36:38.541 --> 00:36:39.125
One more time!

00:36:46.500 --> 00:36:47.250
Again!

00:37:13.500 --> 00:37:16.375
So, if you look into my eyes and give an order,

00:37:16.375 --> 00:37:17.666
I get hypnotized?

00:37:17.708 --> 00:37:18.083
Yeah.

00:37:18.083 --> 00:37:18.250
Oh! 

00:37:18.500 --> 00:37:19.208
I think you got me!

00:37:19.208 --> 00:37:20.458
Don't be silly.

00:37:22.500 --> 00:37:24.291
Help! 

00:37:30.625 --> 00:37:31.083
Oh, no! 

00:37:31.083 --> 00:37:33.833
We gotta stop him or he'll smash up the school again!

00:37:33.833 --> 00:37:35.083
Guess I'll have to stop them!

00:37:58.541 --> 00:37:59.166
Move!

00:38:08.541 --> 00:38:09.958
Come on... Stop!! 

00:38:43.458 --> 00:38:45.000
Frankie... stop...!!!

00:39:05.041 --> 00:39:06.041
There! 

00:39:08.125 --> 00:39:09.333
No one will notice, right? 

00:39:09.333 --> 00:39:10.708
Good as new..!

00:39:15.458 --> 00:39:15.708
Hmm? 

00:39:16.041 --> 00:39:17.333
Uh-! There is a smudge.

00:39:22.666 --> 00:39:24.916
Do you know why I called for you? 

00:39:25.083 --> 00:39:27.083
Um...no, sir 

00:39:27.541 --> 00:39:31.875
Last night, somebody broke the trophy that I treasure the most.

00:39:31.875 --> 00:39:33.750
Oh, who would do that...?

00:39:33.750 --> 00:39:35.750
Exactly 

00:39:38.500 --> 00:39:39.083
Tell me...

00:39:39.083 --> 00:39:41.458
How long are you just going to stand there

00:39:41.458 --> 00:39:43.000
blinking like a fool?

00:39:43.666 --> 00:39:46.708
What...What exactly would you like me to do, sir? 

00:39:46.708 --> 00:39:49.166
I want you to find out...

00:39:49.166 --> 00:39:51.416
WHO DID IT-!!!! 

00:39:51.416 --> 00:39:53.958
A bat's wings are comprised of rubber...

00:39:53.958 --> 00:40:00.041
like elastic membranes stretched between... 

00:40:00.916 --> 00:40:02.541
What is this saying?

00:40:03.666 --> 00:40:04.416
That's right!

00:40:04.416 --> 00:40:05.666
You are a vampire!

00:40:06.916 --> 00:40:08.000
Yeah, so? 

00:40:08.000 --> 00:40:10.833
Then, can't you transform into a bat? 

00:40:10.833 --> 00:40:13.208
Um...yeah...of course. 

00:40:13.208 --> 00:40:13.708
Cool! 

00:40:13.708 --> 00:40:15.250
This is perfect!

00:40:15.250 --> 00:40:18.083
I don't understand all these difficult words, 

00:40:18.083 --> 00:40:21.250
but if I can see a real bat, it'll all make sense!

00:40:21.250 --> 00:40:23.625
What are you getting at? 

00:40:23.625 --> 00:40:25.791
Turn into a bat for me just once.

00:40:25.791 --> 00:40:30.166
Then I think I'll totally ace this test super easily.

00:40:30.166 --> 00:40:31.375
Will you do it? Will you?

00:40:31.375 --> 00:40:32.666
Pretty please?

00:40:32.666 --> 00:40:33.875
No! 

00:40:33.875 --> 00:40:34.916
Hm~~?

00:40:34.916 --> 00:40:36.208
No way!

00:40:36.208 --> 00:40:37.708
Mmmmm~~?

00:40:37.708 --> 00:40:38.875
Forget it~!

00:40:38.875 --> 00:40:40.541
I'm begging you~

00:40:40.541 --> 00:40:41.083
Please~~~~!

00:40:41.083 --> 00:40:42.375
If you don't wanna study, then don't! 

00:40:42.375 --> 00:40:43.583
You're so distracted!

00:40:43.583 --> 00:40:46.125
Oh~You can't do it, can you?

00:40:46.125 --> 00:40:47.625
I can so~!

00:40:47.625 --> 00:40:49.083
It's ok, no need for anger.

00:40:49.083 --> 00:40:50.500
I can do it~!

00:40:50.500 --> 00:40:52.875
I'm just not in the mood to change right now!

00:40:53.166 --> 00:40:54.875
Oh~Okay, okay!

00:40:54.875 --> 00:40:57.791
I'm serious. I'm just not feeling well today.

00:41:01.208 --> 00:41:02.750
I'm a vampire. 

00:41:02.750 --> 00:41:04.041
I'm strong!

00:41:04.041 --> 00:41:05.916
I can become whatever I want!

00:41:18.458 --> 00:41:21.458
Can we...really...transform like this?

00:41:21.458 --> 00:41:23.458
It makes me wanna go number 2.

00:41:23.458 --> 00:41:24.208
Stop talking 

00:41:24.208 --> 00:41:25.541
I can't concentrate!

00:41:25.625 --> 00:41:25.791
Oh... 

00:41:26.166 --> 00:41:27.375
Sorry, sorry!

00:41:35.541 --> 00:41:36.666
Whoa~!

00:41:36.666 --> 00:41:38.000
No way! 

00:41:38.958 --> 00:41:39.666
It worked! 

00:41:39.708 --> 00:41:40.500
It worked! 

00:41:40.500 --> 00:41:42.166
I get it!

00:41:44.791 --> 00:41:47.500
But...how come only one wing formed?

00:41:48.833 --> 00:41:49.750
Oh yeah.

00:42:18.875 --> 00:42:20.000
GEEZ!

00:42:20.250 --> 00:42:22.708
Why can't I do it? UGH!

00:42:22.708 --> 00:42:25.333
Just keep at it. You'll get it eventually.

00:42:52.458 --> 00:42:54.000
You're sooooo cute! 

00:42:55.291 --> 00:42:56.541
I can't take it! 

00:42:56.541 --> 00:42:58.000
You're adorable!

00:42:58.458 --> 00:43:01.208
Aha! So this is what a bat wing looks like!

00:43:01.208 --> 00:43:03.208
I totally get it now.

00:43:04.583 --> 00:43:05.583
Wow~!

00:43:05.833 --> 00:43:08.583
Thank you, you cute little battie! 

00:43:11.666 --> 00:43:14.333
Wait. Shouldn't a bat be flying?

00:43:14.333 --> 00:43:17.041
Hold on, do you not know how to fly?

00:43:17.166 --> 00:43:19.333
What? Are you kidding me? 

00:43:19.375 --> 00:43:20.750
Want me to show you? 

00:43:25.000 --> 00:43:25.750
What was that? 

00:43:25.875 --> 00:43:27.125
Okay~here I go!

00:43:30.875 --> 00:43:32.583
Is everything okay? 

00:43:32.583 --> 00:43:34.208
Good evening, Mr. Kong! 

00:43:35.125 --> 00:43:36.750
I heard screaming.

00:43:36.916 --> 00:43:37.958
Oh...that....

00:43:37.958 --> 00:43:40.083
I got surprised by a bug.

00:43:40.083 --> 00:43:42.416
Where did it go...? Uh..

00:43:57.583 --> 00:43:58.500
Mr. Kong! 

00:43:58.666 --> 00:44:01.375
I'm sooo scared of that bug.

00:44:01.375 --> 00:44:03.458
So would you mind walking me outside? 

00:44:05.208 --> 00:44:06.166
Thank you, Mr. Kong! 

00:44:06.791 --> 00:44:07.541
Wait!

00:44:11.625 --> 00:44:13.625
Come on, Mr. Kong! Let's go~

00:44:13.791 --> 00:44:14.750
I really wanna get out of here.

00:44:14.750 --> 00:44:16.375
Oh Hahah, please don't push~

00:44:16.375 --> 00:44:17.958
I'm sooo scared! 

00:44:18.125 --> 00:44:20.458
Phew...that was close.

00:44:22.625 --> 00:44:24.791
Saturday at 1 PM? 

00:44:24.916 --> 00:44:26.625
When the sun is the hottest?

00:44:26.750 --> 00:44:28.791
She wants to meet at daylight?

00:44:30.083 --> 00:44:30.791
Thank you~

00:44:30.916 --> 00:44:33.125
Mr. Kong! Have a good evening!

00:44:36.541 --> 00:44:38.791
I can't put my finger on it...

00:44:38.791 --> 00:44:40.791
but something smells fishy.

00:44:40.833 --> 00:44:41.208
Huh?

00:44:41.291 --> 00:44:42.458
Good Heavens!

00:44:44.125 --> 00:44:44.708
Mr. Kong! 

00:44:44.708 --> 00:44:46.958
The surveillance camera is up and running.

00:44:47.708 --> 00:44:52.125
Look like I won't have any more damage to school property.

00:45:34.916 --> 00:45:36.250
Are you that happy? 

00:45:36.250 --> 00:45:37.458
Of course~!

00:45:37.458 --> 00:45:39.500
You have no idea how happy.

00:45:39.500 --> 00:45:41.166
You really did it, Hanah

00:45:41.166 --> 00:45:42.375
No~!

00:45:42.375 --> 00:45:43.625
Not just me.

00:45:43.625 --> 00:45:44.875
WE did it!

00:45:45.041 --> 00:45:45.333
Hm!

00:45:45.708 --> 00:45:46.958
We did?

00:45:46.958 --> 00:45:47.750
Yeah! 

00:45:47.750 --> 00:45:50.583
If it weren't for you, this noggin' would never have gotten straight A's!

00:45:50.583 --> 00:45:51.833
There's no way.

00:45:51.833 --> 00:45:53.000
So thanks!

00:45:56.208 --> 00:46:00.041
To show you how grateful I am, I prepared a little surprise for you.

00:46:02.458 --> 00:46:05.166
Ok! Let's put on some screen.

00:46:05.500 --> 00:46:06.708
What are you doing?

00:46:12.500 --> 00:46:13.791
What are you doing to me?

00:46:15.291 --> 00:46:16.791
Where are you taking me? 

00:46:24.875 --> 00:46:25.083
Hey

00:46:25.083 --> 00:46:26.875
Hey, wait! Wait!

00:46:27.833 --> 00:46:30.000
I can't leave the school! 

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:31.833
Just trust me, will you?

00:46:31.833 --> 00:46:33.625
We are not going far.

00:46:52.041 --> 00:46:54.041
Ok! Here we are!

00:46:56.375 --> 00:46:57.833
Where is this place? 

00:47:20.083 --> 00:47:22.875
Why do you want a cell phone so much?

00:47:22.875 --> 00:47:25.000
It feels really weird not to have something

00:47:25.000 --> 00:47:27.083
that everyone else has.

00:47:27.291 --> 00:47:30.041
It makes me feel like an outsider.

00:47:30.041 --> 00:47:31.208
Outsider?

00:47:31.208 --> 00:47:35.250
It's when you're all by yourself without any friends.

00:47:35.666 --> 00:47:36.458
That's you!

00:47:37.208 --> 00:47:38.791
What?! I'm not an outsider!

00:47:38.791 --> 00:47:40.458
I have you.

00:47:40.458 --> 00:47:42.458
If you're not my friend, then what?

00:47:44.458 --> 00:47:47.291
So I'm...I'm your friend?

00:47:47.291 --> 00:47:48.583
Of course you are. 

00:47:48.583 --> 00:47:51.333
We study together, we hang out...

00:47:51.333 --> 00:47:54.041
and I even showed my most secret favorite place.

00:47:54.041 --> 00:47:55.458
Of course we're friends!

00:47:56.958 --> 00:47:58.875
We are...friends?

00:48:00.625 --> 00:48:04.166
So...how did you end up living and hiding in the school?

00:48:05.125 --> 00:48:09.791
We were hiding from humans, looking for a safe place, that's how.

00:48:10.875 --> 00:48:12.250
A long time ago 

00:48:12.250 --> 00:48:14.208
We used to live among humans.

00:48:14.208 --> 00:48:16.166
Then, one day, humans started attacking us

00:48:16.166 --> 00:48:18.166
because we looked different from them...

00:48:18.166 --> 00:48:20.583
...and we became monsters.

00:48:20.583 --> 00:48:22.375
If it weren't for Mr. Reaper,

00:48:22.375 --> 00:48:25.250
the others and I wouldn't have survived.

00:48:25.250 --> 00:48:26.750
He took us all over the world

00:48:26.750 --> 00:48:29.958
to find a safe spot for us to live.

00:48:42.125 --> 00:48:43.791
We wandered from place to place,

00:48:43.791 --> 00:48:45.833
hiding and running.

00:48:45.833 --> 00:48:46.666
After a while

00:48:46.666 --> 00:48:48.333
I thought...

00:48:49.416 --> 00:48:51.791
I didn't choose to be born this way.

00:48:52.500 --> 00:48:56.166
Is it my fault that I'm a monster? 

00:48:57.541 --> 00:48:59.583
But then...

00:48:59.583 --> 00:49:01.375
we found the school

00:49:01.375 --> 00:49:04.166
We learned that it was busy with kids during the day,

00:49:04.166 --> 00:49:06.791
but once the bell rang, they'd disappear.

00:49:07.916 --> 00:49:13.250
So, until we're ready to leave the school and live independently without Mr. Reaper's help...

00:49:13.250 --> 00:49:16.083
this school is pretty much our home.

00:49:18.875 --> 00:49:21.333
So that's how you started living there!

00:49:21.708 --> 00:49:22.875
Funny, right?

00:49:25.083 --> 00:49:27.833
We spent all those years trying to hide from humans, 

00:49:27.833 --> 00:49:31.666
but we ended up...living right in the middle of the human world.

00:49:31.666 --> 00:49:34.500
Although, we can only move around at night.

00:49:36.000 --> 00:49:37.750
It must have been tough~

00:49:38.541 --> 00:49:40.833
It's better than living in danger.

00:49:41.250 --> 00:49:42.375
Sorry...

00:49:42.791 --> 00:49:44.708
I'm really sorry.

00:49:46.083 --> 00:49:47.958
What happened in the past...

00:49:47.958 --> 00:49:51.250
And the hardships you're going through now...

00:49:51.250 --> 00:49:53.458
For every human who did horrible things to you.

00:49:53.458 --> 00:49:54.833
I'm sorry 

00:49:55.125 --> 00:49:57.333
But you didn't do any of those things...

00:49:58.041 --> 00:49:58.583
I know...

00:49:59.000 --> 00:50:01.541
but humans aren't all bad, Cula.

00:50:02.250 --> 00:50:05.083
I'm sure you probably know that by now.

00:50:05.291 --> 00:50:07.833
there are good humans too. Like me.

00:50:09.250 --> 00:50:10.291
Oh! You smiled! 

00:50:10.291 --> 00:50:12.000
So you agree with me!

00:50:12.500 --> 00:50:13.333
Yeah, whatever 

00:50:14.166 --> 00:50:15.291
Alright, let's go! 

00:50:15.291 --> 00:50:16.166
Go where? 

00:50:16.166 --> 00:50:17.000
To school 

00:50:17.000 --> 00:50:18.333
For independence training!

00:50:18.416 --> 00:50:19.041
What?

00:50:19.208 --> 00:50:21.625
But I need Mr. Reaper's permission to do that!

00:50:21.625 --> 00:50:23.750
How long are you gonna wait for his permission?

00:50:23.750 --> 00:50:24.875
Let me help you!

00:50:24.875 --> 00:50:26.083
Oh, come on~

00:50:26.083 --> 00:50:27.750
How can you help me?!

00:50:28.500 --> 00:50:32.125
Last time, I didn't want to embarrass you, so I let it go...

00:50:32.125 --> 00:50:33.666
But, you can't fly~!

00:50:34.666 --> 00:50:37.041
I'm just saying that when humans chase you,

00:50:37.041 --> 00:50:40.125
you can turn into a bat and shoot fly off, just like that!

00:50:43.166 --> 00:50:45.208
Okay, on three...

00:50:45.375 --> 00:50:46.208
One! 

00:50:53.916 --> 00:50:56.041
Flap...harder~!

00:50:58.333 --> 00:51:00.583
Come on, put your back into it!

00:51:03.291 --> 00:51:04.375
Watch your form!

00:51:04.375 --> 00:51:05.041
Faster! 

00:51:05.125 --> 00:51:05.500
One two!  

00:51:05.541 --> 00:51:06.041
One two! 

00:51:11.208 --> 00:51:13.541
Well done! I think we're ready.

00:51:15.583 --> 00:51:17.875
It's always been my dream to fly~!

00:51:18.208 --> 00:51:19.041
What?! 

00:51:19.375 --> 00:51:22.875
You put me through all this training...so YOU can fly?!

00:51:22.875 --> 00:51:24.208
Let's go! 

00:51:24.333 --> 00:51:25.625
Where are we going? 

00:51:25.625 --> 00:51:28.583
Just start flying, Cula. We'll figure it out as we go.

00:51:43.208 --> 00:51:44.833
We are flying!!

00:51:45.666 --> 00:51:46.666
Stop it!

00:52:50.750 --> 00:52:51.958
Hold on tight!

00:52:51.958 --> 00:52:53.791
I won't save you even if you fall!

00:53:00.875 --> 00:53:01.500
Hey...

00:53:01.500 --> 00:53:03.458
How are we gonna get home?

00:53:03.500 --> 00:53:04.750
I don't know the way back! 

00:53:06.083 --> 00:53:06.833
Mr. Kong! 

00:53:06.916 --> 00:53:07.875
Mr. Kong! 

00:53:08.166 --> 00:53:09.708
We have a problem!

00:53:10.708 --> 00:53:12.291
You gotta see this! 

00:53:14.041 --> 00:53:14.750
Huh?

00:53:14.916 --> 00:53:16.333
What's that? 

00:53:16.333 --> 00:53:18.250
That's what I told you, sir.

00:53:18.250 --> 00:53:19.208
There's a ghost, it's a real-

00:53:19.208 --> 00:53:21.166
Sh-Shush!

00:53:21.208 --> 00:53:23.166
What if somebody hears you? 

00:53:25.125 --> 00:53:26.791
What is going on?

00:53:31.208 --> 00:53:33.791
A ghost in my school? That's insane...!

00:53:38.875 --> 00:53:40.500
Oh Good Heavens!!

00:53:41.208 --> 00:53:42.666
Can I be of service?

00:53:47.416 --> 00:53:48.875
Bingo! 

00:53:49.041 --> 00:53:50.125
Wow~!

00:53:50.291 --> 00:53:52.333
Your reputation speaks for itself! 

00:53:52.333 --> 00:53:54.000
How did you find the location right away? 

00:53:54.000 --> 00:53:55.166
Shush! 

00:53:55.166 --> 00:53:57.458
You talk way too much.

00:53:57.500 --> 00:53:59.625
It's getting in the way of my work!

00:53:59.625 --> 00:54:00.458
Huh?!

00:54:00.916 --> 00:54:03.291
Stop disturbing him and do something useful!

00:54:14.500 --> 00:54:16.625
A bunch of little weaklings!

00:54:17.000 --> 00:54:17.958
A goblin! 

00:54:17.958 --> 00:54:19.041
Jianshi! 

00:54:19.041 --> 00:54:20.125
Zombie! 

00:54:20.125 --> 00:54:21.791
Frankenstein~?

00:54:21.791 --> 00:54:24.125
And the one who controls them...

00:54:24.125 --> 00:54:26.250
the grim reaper~!

00:54:26.291 --> 00:54:27.625
Huh?! Five of them? 

00:54:27.625 --> 00:54:30.458
Plus...a blood sucking vampire!

00:54:30.458 --> 00:54:34.041
Oh my~please just get them out of my school~

00:54:34.541 --> 00:54:39.625
Payment up front, no discounts and cash only...!

00:54:39.625 --> 00:54:43.416
Well...the school's financial situation isn't good...

00:54:43.500 --> 00:54:45.958
Ah! But...I'm sure we can manage.

00:54:45.958 --> 00:54:47.666
Better hurry and get it then!

00:54:47.958 --> 00:54:51.250
This is the last class of the semester. 

00:54:51.250 --> 00:54:54.250
There were students that I wish had performed better;

00:54:54.666 --> 00:54:57.000
students that could've made more effort:

00:54:57.208 --> 00:55:00.250
and others who showed some impressive growth.

00:55:00.500 --> 00:55:04.166
Having said that, I know that you have all made an effort.

00:55:04.166 --> 00:55:07.208
So, for tonight I want you...to have fun!

00:55:54.291 --> 00:55:55.750
Surprise! 

00:55:56.291 --> 00:55:57.375
Ha..nah??? 

00:55:57.375 --> 00:55:58.625
I nailed it, right? 

00:55:58.625 --> 00:55:59.958
Do I look like a monster? 

00:56:00.125 --> 00:56:03.000
You'll get in trouble if Mr. Reaper sees you! 

00:56:03.291 --> 00:56:04.375
You gotta go! 

00:56:04.375 --> 00:56:04.833
Now!

00:56:04.833 --> 00:56:06.875
Wow~! This party is so cool! 

00:56:07.083 --> 00:56:08.541
Good music, good lighting~

00:56:09.416 --> 00:56:11.958
Oh, this party's just my scene!

00:56:13.333 --> 00:56:15.583
Uh, Hi! Remember me? 

00:56:15.833 --> 00:56:17.958
Ah! You're the human kid from before!

00:56:17.958 --> 00:56:19.541
Human? 

00:56:20.500 --> 00:56:21.750
Cula! 

00:56:21.750 --> 00:56:24.666
Have you been talking to this human behind our backs? 

00:56:25.541 --> 00:56:26.583
I can explain.

00:56:26.583 --> 00:56:28.291
Let me explain things.

00:56:28.291 --> 00:56:29.625
So what happened was-

00:56:29.625 --> 00:56:30.458
Hey!

00:56:30.458 --> 00:56:31.541
Stay out of this, human!

00:56:31.791 --> 00:56:33.791
We need to hear it from Cula.

00:56:33.791 --> 00:56:34.833
So tell us Why?! 

00:56:34.833 --> 00:56:36.166
You went behind our backs?! 

00:56:36.166 --> 00:56:38.375
Breaking the rules...by meeting this little human?

00:56:38.375 --> 00:56:40.083
And it better be good!

00:56:40.500 --> 00:56:41.125
Now? 

00:56:42.625 --> 00:56:44.333
Yeah, tell them, Cula.

00:56:51.916 --> 00:56:53.208
You want one? 

00:56:53.541 --> 00:56:54.250
Wait!

00:56:54.250 --> 00:56:56.458
Do you think you can buy us off with some candy? 

00:57:44.583 --> 00:57:47.625
What is that awful music? 

00:57:52.416 --> 00:57:55.083
Much better! Now, THIS is music!

00:57:57.791 --> 00:57:59.583
Het, what's with this music?

00:57:59.583 --> 00:58:00.583
What is this?

00:58:12.291 --> 00:58:13.958
Hello, kiddos! 

00:58:14.166 --> 00:58:15.416
Hu...human! 

00:58:20.875 --> 00:58:21.333
Janshi! 

00:58:21.625 --> 00:58:22.083
Goblin!

00:58:22.458 --> 00:58:22.916
Zombie!

00:58:23.416 --> 00:58:24.500
Frankenstein!

00:58:25.208 --> 00:58:26.208
And you~~

00:58:26.708 --> 00:58:28.500
You're a vampire? 

00:58:29.250 --> 00:58:31.000
Careful, or else!

00:58:31.000 --> 00:58:33.125
You'll hurt yourself badly.

00:58:33.875 --> 00:58:36.916
This here is my latest cutting-edge invention.

00:58:37.458 --> 00:58:41.583
A shot of this won't harm a hair on a warm-blooded human like me.

00:58:41.583 --> 00:58:44.583
but for monsters like you... 

00:58:48.875 --> 00:58:51.041
Oh my, the whole school will be damaged~!

00:58:51.041 --> 00:58:51.375
EET!

00:58:51.375 --> 00:58:52.583
This could be your fate~!

00:58:52.583 --> 00:58:56.750
So if I were you, I'd stay put and not try anything foolish.

00:58:57.291 --> 00:59:00.750
This laser has exactly the same effect... 

00:59:00.750 --> 00:59:03.166
So don't move!

00:59:23.416 --> 00:59:24.583
Peek-A-Boo!! 

00:59:26.291 --> 00:59:27.000
Drats!

00:59:40.541 --> 00:59:41.000
Oh! 

00:59:41.000 --> 00:59:42.833
Th-There he is!! 

01:00:13.458 --> 01:00:14.750
Stop right there! 

01:00:14.916 --> 01:00:15.750
STOP~!

01:00:24.291 --> 01:00:25.916
Leave us alone!

01:00:35.625 --> 01:00:38.583
Gotcha, didn't I, kiddo?

01:00:38.750 --> 01:00:39.583
Look, 

01:00:39.583 --> 01:00:41.375
I'm THE HUNTER. 

01:00:41.375 --> 01:00:42.666
Get it? 

01:00:42.666 --> 01:00:47.791
As long as I have these glasses on your hypnotic tricks won't work on me.

01:00:47.791 --> 01:00:49.166
Farewell, kid!

01:01:15.375 --> 01:01:16.125
Mr. Reaper!

01:01:16.125 --> 01:01:17.083
It's urgent!

01:01:17.375 --> 01:01:18.208
Cula?! 

01:01:18.208 --> 01:01:21.291
Humans...a hunter, I mean a human called Hunter... 

01:01:21.291 --> 01:01:23.416
Humans? A Hunter? 

01:01:23.416 --> 01:01:24.541
It's my fault... 

01:01:24.541 --> 01:01:26.458
Everyone got captured~!

01:01:26.666 --> 01:01:28.125
What do you mean 'captured'?

01:01:28.125 --> 01:01:28.833
Wait!

01:01:28.833 --> 01:01:31.291
I had no choice but to go out into the human world.

01:01:31.291 --> 01:01:33.000
And that's when I met this girl...

01:01:33.000 --> 01:01:35.333
I was only gonna help her get straight A's.

01:01:35.333 --> 01:01:36.250
That's the truth. 

01:01:36.250 --> 01:01:38.791
Then I wasn't going to ever see her again.

01:01:39.500 --> 01:01:40.916
This is all my fault.

01:01:48.458 --> 01:01:50.583
Oooohhh, I'm so scared! 

01:01:54.000 --> 01:01:56.125
Come on, don't be mean,

01:01:56.125 --> 01:01:58.041
you're frightening the little kid.

01:02:00.416 --> 01:02:01.333
Go, Cula! 

01:02:08.083 --> 01:02:09.916
Get out of here, now!

01:02:10.166 --> 01:02:11.291
Go!

01:02:11.291 --> 01:02:12.041
Hurry~!

01:02:12.041 --> 01:02:13.333
Come on!

01:02:13.333 --> 01:02:17.416
Let the kid witness the last moments of his teacher~

01:02:17.416 --> 01:02:20.833
Just you wait, little one. It won't take that long.

01:02:21.458 --> 01:02:22.708
I said go! 

01:02:27.958 --> 01:02:29.041
Cula! 

01:02:30.625 --> 01:02:34.833
I feel sad that I wasn't kinder to you.

01:02:34.833 --> 01:02:36.375
I'm very sorry~

01:03:32.250 --> 01:03:33.583
It's heavy.

01:03:34.208 --> 01:03:35.083
Mr. Reaper?!! 

01:03:35.166 --> 01:03:35.875
Mr. Reaper...

01:03:37.083 --> 01:03:38.625
Mr. Reaper... 

01:03:44.750 --> 01:03:50.375
Uh... you know, I think that child over there...is one of my students.

01:03:52.250 --> 01:03:54.125
Here! This isn't much but.. 

01:03:54.125 --> 01:03:58.458
Oh~! Actually, on second look, she is a human kid.

01:03:59.833 --> 01:04:01.041
Little girl~

01:04:01.041 --> 01:04:03.583
How come you didn't say anything to us, eh?

01:04:03.708 --> 01:04:05.166
Did these savages hurt you?

01:04:05.166 --> 01:04:06.875
They're not savages! 

01:04:06.875 --> 01:04:09.083
Everyone here is my friend, ok?!

01:04:11.708 --> 01:04:13.458
Your friends? 

01:04:13.625 --> 01:04:15.708
Sweetie pie... 

01:04:15.708 --> 01:04:20.625
Humans and savages can never ever be friends. 

01:04:20.625 --> 01:04:22.125
Savages inside!

01:04:22.666 --> 01:04:24.208
And humans outside!

01:04:24.416 --> 01:04:26.583
We belong to separate and different worlds. 

01:04:26.583 --> 01:04:28.333
Do you get it now?

01:04:29.375 --> 01:04:29.916
No...

01:04:40.958 --> 01:04:44.000
What's gonna happen to us? 

01:05:00.125 --> 01:05:01.916
You're awake! 

01:05:02.333 --> 01:05:04.000
Oh, Zizi 

01:05:08.500 --> 01:05:11.291
You guys got away safely.

01:05:12.208 --> 01:05:14.833
I thought you wanted to live by yourself?

01:05:15.458 --> 01:05:16.583
Happy?

01:05:16.750 --> 01:05:18.583
By yourself? 

01:05:19.833 --> 01:05:20.666
Cula!

01:05:21.166 --> 01:05:23.291
Remember, I'm your sidekick~!

01:05:23.708 --> 01:05:26.750
Wherever you go, I'll always be there.

01:05:29.791 --> 01:05:31.375
Yeah, ok... 

01:05:39.041 --> 01:05:40.416
But...Mr. Reaper... 

01:05:48.208 --> 01:05:49.666
Mr. Reaper! 

01:05:51.250 --> 01:05:53.250
You were right about everything! 

01:05:53.250 --> 01:05:55.666
I'll never meet a human ever again! 

01:05:55.666 --> 01:05:57.958
I'm so sorry! Please forgive me!

01:06:10.083 --> 01:06:11.458
It's all my fault.

01:06:11.916 --> 01:06:14.166
If only I hadn't met Hanah... 

01:06:27.583 --> 01:06:28.333
This place... 

01:06:47.958 --> 01:06:52.333
They say the ultimate test of friendship is risking your life for a friend.

01:06:54.333 --> 01:06:56.958
That's what friends do.

01:07:03.625 --> 01:07:05.541
I can't survive by myself.

01:07:09.458 --> 01:07:10.750
My friends 

01:07:10.750 --> 01:07:11.916
and Hanah 

01:07:11.916 --> 01:07:13.833
They need my help! 

01:07:13.833 --> 01:07:17.041
I gotta save them before day breaks! 

01:07:19.833 --> 01:07:21.000
You're lucky.

01:07:21.250 --> 01:07:23.041
Six monsters with just this?

01:07:23.041 --> 01:07:24.791
You gotta huge bargain~

01:07:24.791 --> 01:07:25.875
Ummm...sure 

01:07:28.291 --> 01:07:29.791
Well, I have to go.

01:07:29.791 --> 01:07:31.541
No rest for the wicked!

01:07:43.458 --> 01:07:45.333
Bye bye~~~

01:08:33.458 --> 01:08:34.916
Cula! 

01:08:40.208 --> 01:08:42.458
You little fly! 

01:08:45.333 --> 01:08:48.791
I felt sad letting you get away. Now, I'm happy.

01:08:48.791 --> 01:08:51.250
But why would you come back here voluntarily? 

01:08:54.208 --> 01:08:54.916
Let me go!

01:09:03.708 --> 01:09:05.333
He's going to destroy the entire school!

01:09:05.333 --> 01:09:05.583
Huh?

01:09:06.000 --> 01:09:06.791
Hanah! 

01:09:12.458 --> 01:09:14.916
Oh Man, you're a nimble one! 

01:09:14.916 --> 01:09:17.416
But play time is over. Let's end this, shall we? 

01:09:18.125 --> 01:09:20.541
You coward! You're the only one with a gun! 

01:09:21.416 --> 01:09:23.916
Put the gun down, and let's make this a fair fight! 

01:09:23.916 --> 01:09:25.041
Two against one! 

01:09:27.666 --> 01:09:29.083
I...gotta help her.

01:09:29.083 --> 01:09:31.375
You can't. Not with your injuries 

01:09:31.375 --> 01:09:33.750
But even that stick-thin human girl with a big head's 

01:09:33.750 --> 01:09:35.750
doing what she can to help Cula.

01:09:35.958 --> 01:09:38.166
I can't just hide here and watch.

01:09:38.666 --> 01:09:42.458
You can't wait to get a glimpse of the other world, can ya? 

01:09:42.458 --> 01:09:43.791
Fine~

01:09:43.791 --> 01:09:44.916
Any last worlds~?

01:09:44.916 --> 01:09:45.375
Stop!

01:10:10.041 --> 01:10:12.416
Ha! Do I have to take things into my own hands? 

01:10:30.541 --> 01:10:31.166
Move, Hanah! 

01:10:31.333 --> 01:10:34.416
In our school, anyone can come learn and grow~!

01:10:35.208 --> 01:10:38.083
That's what you tell us all the time, Principal Kong!

01:10:38.333 --> 01:10:41.500
These kids also learning and growing at this school

01:10:41.500 --> 01:10:45.500
and they actually love this school just as much as you do, sir!

01:11:23.458 --> 01:11:25.291
Did you forget what I said? 

01:11:25.291 --> 01:11:30.041
With these glasses on your silly parlor tick won't work, kid.

01:11:30.208 --> 01:11:31.125
Well, well! 

01:11:31.125 --> 01:11:32.916
Talk about perfect timing~!

01:11:45.083 --> 01:11:46.250
Cula...

01:12:01.541 --> 01:12:03.625
Give it a rest, will ya? 

01:12:04.125 --> 01:12:05.750
Just stay down~!

01:12:19.583 --> 01:12:21.166
Let's see here...

01:12:22.291 --> 01:12:24.166
Now, what am I gonna do about you?

01:12:24.625 --> 01:12:27.125
How can I teach you to stop hanging out 

01:12:27.125 --> 01:12:31.208
with those savages for good and be a good little human girl? 

01:12:37.125 --> 01:12:38.541
Hey, mister! 

01:12:40.291 --> 01:12:41.833
Don't you...

01:12:41.833 --> 01:12:43.875
dare touch my friend!

01:12:43.875 --> 01:12:46.208
Come on...haven't you had enough yet?!

01:12:46.208 --> 01:12:49.208
Run away, Cula! This man is crazy! 

01:12:49.416 --> 01:12:49.875
What?!

01:12:50.083 --> 01:12:52.125
Say that again, you little brat!

01:12:54.375 --> 01:12:55.833
Ah! What have you done? 

01:12:56.125 --> 01:12:56.791
Savages! 

01:12:56.791 --> 01:12:57.750
All of you! 

01:12:59.791 --> 01:13:01.750
Who are you calling savages?

01:13:03.541 --> 01:13:04.875
I could crush~~

01:13:05.875 --> 01:13:07.375
That's enough, sir.

01:13:07.375 --> 01:13:10.875
I will not allow anyone to physically assault my students.

01:13:11.875 --> 01:13:13.041
Let go of me! 

01:13:13.041 --> 01:13:15.875
Are you seriously taking the savages' side now?

01:13:15.875 --> 01:13:17.958
I advise you to watch your language~!

01:13:17.958 --> 01:13:19.291
Who's a savage?

01:13:25.041 --> 01:13:25.750
What?

01:13:25.750 --> 01:13:27.083
Is this thing broken? 

01:13:27.083 --> 01:13:28.083
Ah~

01:13:28.083 --> 01:13:31.250
that gun doesn't work if you have a warm body, right? 

01:13:31.250 --> 01:13:33.333
Thanks to you exposing me to the sun, 

01:13:33.333 --> 01:13:35.666
I'm raging hot with fever!

01:13:49.958 --> 01:13:51.041
Feels good!

01:13:53.208 --> 01:13:54.458
Now! It's my turn~

01:13:54.458 --> 01:13:55.375
HERE I GO!

01:14:20.500 --> 01:14:22.625
So...what happened after? 

01:14:23.333 --> 01:14:26.166
Everything worked out thanks to my hypnosis.

01:14:26.708 --> 01:14:30.916
Well...I did have to make a few "adjustments" here and there

01:14:31.708 --> 01:14:32.916
Kidnap a kid? 

01:14:33.041 --> 01:14:34.041
Who me? 

01:14:34.041 --> 01:14:35.833
There's no way!

01:14:35.833 --> 01:14:38.000
I really don't remember a single thing. 

01:14:38.000 --> 01:14:39.500
I'm telling the truth! 

01:14:39.500 --> 01:14:40.208
Pipe down!

01:14:40.375 --> 01:14:41.958
It's too dark in here!

01:14:41.958 --> 01:14:43.166
I'm scared~~!

01:14:43.875 --> 01:14:47.333
And Hanah's dad, who almost lost his daughter to a kidnapper... 

01:14:47.500 --> 01:14:48.208
Your grades?

01:14:48.208 --> 01:14:50.125
I don't care about good grades!

01:14:50.125 --> 01:14:51.458
What good are A's?

01:14:51.458 --> 01:14:53.833
An A is just a letter of the alphabet! 

01:14:54.125 --> 01:14:56.750
To be honest, I barely got C's in school.

01:14:56.875 --> 01:14:59.166
Just stay healthy, okay, sweetheart?

01:14:59.416 --> 01:15:00.458
Uh Dad...

01:15:00.666 --> 01:15:02.541
maybe you should let me breathe then...

01:15:02.541 --> 01:15:06.166
Hey, you know you're perfect just the way you are, right?

01:15:06.166 --> 01:15:07.250
Yeah! 

01:15:07.666 --> 01:15:08.916
That's my girl! 

01:15:08.916 --> 01:15:10.791
Oh I love you so much! 

01:15:10.791 --> 01:15:11.916
I really do~

01:15:12.833 --> 01:15:15.875
And the Principal, who saved Hanah from the hands of a kidnapper, 

01:15:15.875 --> 01:15:19.041
graced newspapers and TV shows as a hero.

01:15:20.208 --> 01:15:22.875
Thanks to that, he's getting tons of new student enrollment 

01:15:22.875 --> 01:15:26.750
because they want to attend a school that puts students' safety first.

01:15:28.166 --> 01:15:30.500
Oh, and what about Mr. Reaper?

01:15:32.458 --> 01:15:35.166
We have Zizi, the master of jigsaw puzzles. 

01:15:35.958 --> 01:15:38.583
So we put Mr. Reaper back together.

01:15:40.708 --> 01:15:41.833
Mr. Reaper! 

01:15:42.166 --> 01:15:43.625
Mr. Reaper!! 

01:15:44.125 --> 01:15:46.041
Mr. Reaper wanted us to leave the school

01:15:46.041 --> 01:15:48.833
but after hearing about Hanah, he changed his mind 

01:15:48.833 --> 01:15:50.958
You were right, Cula 

01:15:50.958 --> 01:15:53.666
Not all humans beings are bad.

01:15:54.000 --> 01:15:55.916
We'll put moving on hold for now.

01:15:56.083 --> 01:15:56.875
Hurray!

01:16:01.750 --> 01:16:04.375
And Hanah... she can't remember us anymore.

01:16:04.666 --> 01:16:06.958
I had to do it, for our safety.

01:16:07.041 --> 01:16:09.208
But I still think of Hanah as my friend.

01:16:10.583 --> 01:16:14.041
We shared a friendship that we were willing to risk our lives for.

01:16:14.041 --> 01:16:15.916
That's a friend for life!

01:16:16.541 --> 01:16:18.041
If it weren't for Hanah 

01:16:18.041 --> 01:16:21.625
I wouldn't have learned to appreciate my friends now.

01:16:27.541 --> 01:16:29.750
Hey, Zizi!...what's...up? 

01:16:48.666 --> 01:16:50.708
My very first human friend...

01:16:50.708 --> 01:16:51.833
same as always.

01:16:52.583 --> 01:16:54.916
Thanks to Hanah, we have new hope now.

01:16:55.416 --> 01:16:57.541
Hope that one day humans and monsters 

01:16:57.541 --> 01:17:00.291
will live in peace with no hate.

01:17:01.958 --> 01:17:04.833
And that I can admire this beautiful world once again 

01:17:04.833 --> 01:17:06.541
with my dear friend one day.

01:17:12.208 --> 01:17:13.125
Ok!

01:17:13.416 --> 01:17:15.125
Who wants to return this to Hanah~?

01:17:15.500 --> 01:17:17.000
Me! I want to!

01:17:17.000 --> 01:17:18.166
I called dibs first! 

01:17:18.875 --> 01:17:20.666
You went last time! 

01:17:21.083 --> 01:17:22.041
Cula 

01:17:22.958 --> 01:17:24.916
How about...we go together? 

01:17:24.916 --> 01:17:27.666
What if we get caught by the humans? 

01:17:27.833 --> 01:17:29.208
Oh, no! 

01:17:29.291 --> 01:17:29.833
No! 

01:17:29.833 --> 01:17:30.375
Ah~?! 

01:17:31.000 --> 01:17:33.000
If that happens...then I'll just...

01:17:33.000 --> 01:17:35.125
BAM! Hypnotize them! 

01:17:42.291 --> 01:17:42.750
BAM! 

